, human rights, and the power of knowledge to her mission.</p><p>As an author and vocal advocate for Afghan women’s rights, she stands at the forefront of campaigns like #LetAfghanGirlsLearn, striving to restore education, opportunity, and hope to countless girls. Her diverse experiences—from mentoring university students, coordinating entrepreneurial programs, to volunteering for cultural heritage restoration—reflect a lifelong commitment to empowering individuals and fostering vibrant communities.</p><p>Through Qatra, Hosai Ayubi transforms small drops of effort into waves of change, championing artistry, independence, and brighter futures for women across Afghanistan.<br>&nbsp;</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:17:\"field_contributer\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"7\";}}}s:23:\"field_contributor_video\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"8\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:6:\"people\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"10\";s:8:\"revision\";s:2:\"17\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"6e1b6c15-d0c7-4662-b11a-fc8e05f4d97f\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:8:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:11:\"Hosai Ayubi\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:9:\"published\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langco