't wait for someone else to provide for you.\"</p>','','basic_html'),
('projects',0,15,27,'en',0,'<p>Named in honor of our founder’s grandmother, Marhama (بی بی مرحمه) is dedicated to uplifting women breadwinners across Afghanistan. Through our holistic approach, we equip women with sewing machines and essential supplies, create safe, women-led workspaces, and offer comprehensive skills training and capacity-building programs. By also facilitating international marketing of their handcrafted products, we help these women secure sustainable incomes, fostering resilience, dignity, and economic independence in their communities.</p>','','basic_html'),
('projects',0,15,28,'en',0,'<p><strong>Marhama – Dignity Through Handcraft</strong></p><p>Named in honor of our founder’s grandmother, Marhama (بی بی مرحمه) is dedicated to uplifting women breadwinners across Afghanistan. Through our holistic approach, we equip women with sewing machines and essential supplies, create safe, women-led workspaces, and offer comprehensive skills training and capacity-building programs. By also facilitating international marketing of their handcrafted products, we help these women secure sustainable incomes, fostering resilience, dignity, and economic independence in their communities.</p>','','basic_html'),
('projects',0,16,29,'en',0,'<p>Nadera project supports orphaned children who are forced into labor. We provide: - Education sponsorship -</p><p>Safe learning environments - Daily meals - School supplies - monthly ration for their families.</p><p>● Why It Matters</p><p>Millions of Afghan children are at risk of child labor due to poverty and lack of access to education. Nadera</p><p>gives them a chance to learn and dream again</p>','','basic_html'),
('projects',0,16,30,'en',0,'<p><strong>Nadera – Education for Orphaned Children</strong></p><p>Nadera project supports orphaned children who are forced into labor. We provide: - Education sponsorship -</p><p>Safe learning environments - Daily meals - School supplies - monthly ration for their families.</p><p>● Why It Matters</p><p>Millions of Afghan children are at risk of child labor due to poverty and lack of access to education. Nadera</p><p>gives them a chance to learn and dream again</p>','','basic_html'),
('projects',0,16,31,'en',0,'<p><strong>Nadera – Education for Orphaned Children</strong></p><p>Nadera project supports orphaned children who are forced into labor. We provide: - Education sponsorship -</p><p>Safe learning environments - Daily meals - School supplies - monthly ration for their families.</p><p>● Why It Matters</p><p>Millions of Afghan children are at risk of child labor due to poverty and lack of access to education. Nadera</p><p>gives them a chance to learn and dream again</p>','','basic_html'),
('page',0,17,32,'en',0,'<h3>Mailing Address</h3><p>.... Germany</p><p>​</p><p>United States</p><p>Lexington , KY ...</p><h3>Email</h3><p><a href=\"mailto:info@auaf.edu.af\">info@qatra.com</a></p><h3>Visiting Hours for Germany Office</h3><p>Sunday - Thursday: 8:00 am - 4:00 pm</p><p>Friday and Saturday is a Weekend</p>','','basic_html'),
('page',0,17,34,'en',0,'<h3>Mailing Address</h3><h3>Email</h3><p><a href=\"mailto:info@auaf.edu.af\">info@qatra.com</a></p><h3>Visiting Hours for Germany Office</h3><p>Sunday - Thursday: 8:00 am - 4:00 pm</p><p>Friday and Saturday is a Weekend</p>','','basic_html');
